{"id": 18, "seek": 8232, "start": 107.74, "end": 111.83999999999999, "text": " Honestly, it sets up the whole premise. It really does. So our mission today is to figure out", "tokens": [51636, 12348, 11, 309, 6352, 493, 264, 1379, 22045, 13, 467, 534, 775, 13, 407, 527, 4447, 965, 307, 281, 2573, 484, 51841], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07215152523381924, "compression_ratio": 1.6274509803921569, "no_speech_prob": 1.3719712215268243e-12}, {"id": 19, "seek": 11184, "start": 111.84, "end": 118.9, "text": " why the secret to improving a complex, already functioning AI might just be fixing one single", "tokens": [50365, 983, 264, 4054, 281, 11470, 257, 3997, 11, 1217, 18483, 7318, 1062, 445, 312, 19442, 472, 2167, 50718], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.04715272024566052, "compression_ratio": 1.604026845637584, "no_speech_prob": 1.5489150760605863e-12}, {"id": 20, "seek": 11184, "start": 118.9, "end": 122.5, "text": " layer instead of rebuilding the whole machine from scratch. And perhaps more importantly,", "tokens": [50718, 4583, 2602, 295, 36717, 264, 1379, 3479, 490, 8459, 13, 400, 4317, 544, 8906, 11, 50898], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.04715272024566052, "compression_ratio": 1.604026845637584, "no_speech_prob": 1.5489150760605863e-12}, {"id": 21, "seek": 11184, "start": 122.60000000000001, "end": 126.60000000000001, "text": " we want to look at what that teaches us about complex systems everywhere, not just, you know,", "tokens": [50903, 321, 528, 281, 574, 412, 437, 300, 16876, 505, 466, 3997, 3652, 5315, 11, 406, 445, 11, 291, 458, 11, 51103], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.04715272024566052, "compression_ratio": 1.604026845637584, "no_speech_prob": 1.5489150760605863e-12}, {"id": 22, "seek": 11184, "start": 126.68, "end": 133.64000000000001, "text": " inside a server rack. Exactly. But to really grasp what this paper is arguing, we have to start with", "tokens": [51107, 1854, 257, 7154, 14788, 13, 7587, 13, 583, 281, 534, 21743, 